<title>UK: London gold ends barely changed, off day's lows.</title>
<headline>London gold ends barely changed, off day's lows.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closes at $378.40/$378.90, up five cents from Monday. Bounces off morning's lows on afternoon shortcovering rally after fixing at 18-month low in the morning.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ends four cents firmer at $4.90/$4.92. Also rallied on shortcovering, coming off from lows in the low $4.80s.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Also closes stronger at $383.75/$384.75, up $1.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Finishes 75 cents stronger at $119.00/$120.00.</p>
</text>
